{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>And Moses spoke to YHWH, saying.</b> In Moses' speaking to YHWH there was no need for the word לאמר; rather, it was because of Moses' greatness, so as to link the disciple to the master — as they said in the Midrash: 'I spoke with you in speech and in saying — וידבר ה' אל משה לאמר; so you too spoke before Me in speech and in saying — וידבר משה אל ה' לאמר.'"], :book :numbers, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:36:30.407391806Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}